            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.39.17+EZK.39.18+EZK.39.19+EZK.39.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 39:17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Bwanyima naareeba maraika ondiijo ayemereire omu izooba, yaayeta n'eiraka rihango, naagambira amahungu goona agarikuzereera ahaiguru omu mwanya, ati: Mwije, muteeranire aha bugyenyi bukuru obwa Ruhanga, ",
          "type": "text",
