          "text": " Enyamaishwa egyo yaakwatwa hamwe na nabi w'ebishuba, owaabaire akora obumanyiso omu maisho gaayo, naabibeihabeihesa abo abaine akamanyiso k'enyamaishwa n'abarikuramya ekishushani kyayo. Abo bombi baanagwa omu nyanja erikwakamu omuriro n'obuganga bw'ekibiriiti bahuriire. ",
